    {
      "id": "fvxqw2c",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Troposphere"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wrut0g7",
      "content": "• Lowest layer of the atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Composition of the Atmosphere, Importance of the Atmosphere, and Layers of the Atmosphere: Troposphere, Stratosphere, Mesosphere, Thermosphere, Exosphere.",
      "id": "oge5hx3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n3b26yz",
      "content": "• Contains about 75% of atmospheric mass."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4hvyat7",
      "content": "• All weather phenomena such as clouds, rain and storms occur here."
    },
    {
      "id": "taw3ndc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Stratosphere"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6cdrerb",
      "content": "• Located above the troposphere."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2lf14ys",
      "content": "• Contains the ozone layer that absorbs harmful ultraviolet radiation."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6nmnooq",
      "content": "• Jet aircraft often fly in this layer."
    },
    {
      "id": "9p89z2y",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Mesosphere"
    },
